> I got a BoH from sokoban. I have two blessed magic lamps. I am
> planning on wishing for SDSM and Scepter of Might for reflection and
> MR respectively. I thought of getting the scepter as it doubles as a
> descent weapon against cross-aligned monsters and provides hunger-less
> conflict.
> 
> I am playing a Samurai who is at Expert level in twoweapon fighting
> and has Excalibur. Is what I am planning OK or is there a better
> combination for a duel wielding Samurai?

That's solid, especially if you don't already have a ring of conflict.

Don't bother enchanting it up or wielding it, though.  Samurai are 
Unskilled at maces, and Excalibur is perfectly adequate for ascension.

Oh, and keep in mind that you only have a 64% chance of getting both 
wishes.

